  "details": "CRT Update Zones are instrumental in performance when utilizing CRT updates, as without them you need to update an *entire* CRT's contents, and with them you can choose to update one localized area. However, CRT update zones aren't supported by Udon yet, which seems to be a massive oversight as they significantly reduce the cost of updating custom render textures.",
